Usage: millstream trigger <pipeline> <trigger> [flags]
       millstream trigger <command> [<args>] [flags]

Fire a trigger by hand, or replace a webhook trigger's token.

Default command:
  trigger <pipeline> <trigger>   Fire a trigger by hand.
                                 Its arguments and flags: "millstream trigger fire --help"

Commands:
  token <pipeline> <trigger>     Replace a webhook trigger's token (--rotate) and print the new one,
                                 once.

Run "millstream trigger <command> --help" for a command's arguments and flags.
